      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e do we still need to allow the host to submit any other QI descriptors than QI_IEC_TYPE (interrupt remapping)?\n\nMore precisely: any others than QI_IEC_TYPE and QI_IWD_TYPE.",
      "parentUuid": "4ab54501_34e7e65b",
      "revId": "68374c9efa17e512e5a65c5a8bd6c7d715b69fd3",
