      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-26T17:15:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e and QI_IWD_TYPE.\n\nScratch that, sorry. pKVM itself submits QI_IWD_TYPE anyway, the host doesn\u0027t need to ask it to.",
      "parentUuid": "13255b3c_881cec77",
      "revId": "68374c9efa17e512e5a65c5a8bd6c7d715b69fd3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
